{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"感受中漏掉了明显的情色热度，以及美好仍在、心里却已感到时间流逝的复杂情绪；但没有把主要处境或原因拼错。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把‘连和他待着都不自在了’说成‘不再喜欢与自己相处’，将可能出现的不自在升级成了不喜欢。完整稿表达的是对相处状态的担忧，并没有说对方不再喜欢他。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把‘眼前的日子还是不够，还想多陪对方一会儿’的渴望写成了‘满足’。完整稿强调的是幸福高涨却仍嫌相处时间不够，并非已经满足。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S14\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"}\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\":\"全曲故事基本完全一致，准确拼出了从小心隐藏喜欢、担忧失去亲近，到逐渐相信彼此可能互相需要、终于表达心愿，最后接受无法保证永远却不再收回真心的完整变化。个别情绪细节有所遗漏或偏差，但没有改变故事主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d84fcca0-8f2e-4b75-b84e-f7621426910b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T034728344648Z", "elapsed_seconds": 120.968, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T03:49:29.319328+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9da80d44029d523f7b6924f91d433938df6f67f8d17991e97edfdc7943b30833", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "i